{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "cefab77025870e03b0a8c742d7d2c47e23a42eca61f2f897189188f4d3ffe898", "ja": "今日は、すっごく楽しかったよ！\nまた劇場で会おうね！　杏奈との約束、だよ♪", "zh": "今天特别开心！\n下次剧场见哦！这是和杏奈的约定♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "8090469d015bd0e4d882fb65612531e4f17a70dc73fe972f1f87dccb9819dae3", "ja": "ワァァァァァァ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b352e5af21035b5e5a545a75621175f2cb4d36f64b3138420e2df511f87c2083", "ja": "（杏奈のライブは、今日も大成功！　新曲もイントロが\n流れた瞬間から、すごい歓声だったな！）", "zh": "（杏奈的演唱会今天也大获成功！新歌从前奏响起的那一刻开始，就引发了热烈的欢呼！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6be17d7bbd5a7ac6e1aa438747763228e4161c3999567d77c3544463f5463b8c", "ja": "お疲れ様、杏奈！　いいステージだったよ！\n新曲も盛り上がって……。", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈！刚才的舞台很棒！\n新歌也让现场气氛高涨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5c576f4bd912fcfee5337c60818cea536e02de10b4944be5519d35b467f23ad8", "ja": "杏奈、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "杏奈，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "8717f0eb3b2375efe4c07aeba8c33e0a40acd41af7caa50af1261da82a5cebfd", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。あのね……。\n杏奈、ふわふわしてる……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。那个……。\n杏奈，感觉轻飘飘的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "578a59a9203cbc0e25d671f6c570200871f6de83a32b17f02b86b407564d7b97", "ja": "今日のステージ、みんな、盛り上がってくれて……\n小さい頃に見た……夢みたい……。", "zh": "今天的舞台，大家都这么热情……\n就像小时候见过的……梦一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "7b0014a4d4fc3d2630b04b62999669ed94859a28dbc6042565f3d78add17ba9f", "ja": "その夢は、かなうよって……\nあの時に言われても、絶対……信じなかった、です。", "zh": "就算那时有人对我说……那个梦想会实现……\n我也绝对……不会相信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bceeeb772b76fb292c5380e2e9fcb9513309bdd72f94f6278812cce0013fe016", "ja": "そうか、小さい頃の自分に……。\nでも、どうしてそう思うんだ？", "zh": "这样啊，是对小时候的自己说的……不过，你为什么会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "8033ef3397fcfe3cb4a114f006a0b3a62faea55a9302e2989bb8028956d5f07a", "ja": "ん……。杏奈……小さい頃は、\n今よりも、お話……苦手だったから……。", "zh": "嗯……因为杏奈……小时候比起现在，更不擅长……和别人聊天……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "4b68ec06aaaeed5d3adfb722cb96c8baf1946a2e03d35ec62636ad1e99f95c42", "ja": "杏奈のお家……たくさん、引っ越ししてたの。\n学校も、何度も変わって……友達も、全然……。", "zh": "杏奈家……以前经常搬家。\n学校也换过很多次……朋友也完全……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "ba96996de8ed51936fae1179c6905120c6eb30321fa883bb4f11bf330a0c2ae2", "ja": "それで、知らない人に、話しかけるの……\n怖くなって……。", "zh": "所以，变得害怕……和不认识的人搭话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1014_p", "source_sha256": "688049e9f3cd399200b688bf5215f2567588318fadc18146ba4d46483b1cd732", "ja": "そうだったのか……。教えてくれてありがとうな。\nでも、今の杏奈が言うなら、信じてくれると思うよ。", "zh": "原来是这样……谢谢你告诉我。\n不过，如果是现在的杏奈说的话，大家应该会相信你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4b7e08fe9fe601be3d3da184d901d119f8ba0b33957be853b89465cec7d88664", "ja": "今日みたいに、今の杏奈はたくさんのファンと心で\n繋がれるんだ。小さい杏奈とも、きっと通じ合える。", "zh": "就像今天这样，现在的杏奈能和许多粉丝心意相通。和小时候的杏奈，也一定能彼此理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8d060ea2a5a70c69d401da52019c4c52f96fe173d529e35a4f514d6239ab67a9", "ja": "たくさんの元気と勇気をあげられるんじゃないかな。\n小さい杏奈が夢みた、TVのアイドルそのままに。", "zh": "我想，应该能带给大家许多活力和勇气吧。就像小时候的杏奈所憧憬的，电视里的偶像一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "d5da2112fea703221a0fe3709e97a3019ebfef5ca02c1050de6525c37a997b17", "ja": "あ……。\n杏奈の夢の……、アイドル……。", "zh": "啊……。\n杏奈的梦想……偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "440b0c9973fdce7c58263d631f3a38a86c0a436b6e60365519f9310a2986d43c", "ja": "あの……。{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1020_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "cf5643fab26d82d003b2f3d62c48132fb6690d6de13a3792014c2001992b9769", "ja": "いつも、ありがと……。{$P$}さんと\n一緒だから、杏奈……今日も、がんばれました……。", "zh": "一直以来，谢谢你……。因为有{$P$}先生陪着，\n杏奈……今天也努力过来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0164_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "ada7d89b003bdcb34b2dffbd75d7a077e2b167ef4e45e0c4c40ff3d5e8421902", "ja": "だから……。\nこれからも、よろしくお願いします……です♪", "zh": "所以……\n今后也请多多关照……哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
